MiMo malformed-record proof
Baseline: c15f736ef42158b830b47db1970ea91886e30e85

The proof executes the production Python CLI with synthetic JSONL files, an isolated session root, and an isolated output cache. It reads no account data. The current proof covers invalid UTF-8, non-object JSON, non-string timestamps, and invalid token counts.

