The tests include both a bad byte between valid rows and a truncated UTF-8 sequence at EOF. Expected datetimes are explicit UTC values, so the Z-suffixed input fixtures remain compatible with Python 3.9. The Python 3.9 interpreter is temporary; system Python is unchanged.

